## 🧠 Critical Architectural Rules

### Import Policy (STRICTLY ENFORCED)

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Always use @engine/* aliases
import { Vec3 } from '@engine/core';
import { Scene, Entity } from '@engine/world';
import { Renderer } from '@engine/gfx-webgpu';

// ❌ NEVER use relative paths for packages
import { Vec3 } from '../../packages/core/src/math/Vec3';
```

### Package Boundaries (NO VIOLATIONS)

```
✅ ALLOWED:
- packages → packages (one direction, avoid cycles)
- apps → packages
- Lower-level → Higher-level (core → world → gfx-webgpu)

❌ FORBIDDEN:
- packages → apps
- Higher-level → Lower-level (creates dependency cycles)
- Duplicating package code in apps/
```

### Dependency Hierarchy

```
Level 0: @engine/core (foundation, no deps)
Level 1: @engine/world, @engine/input, @engine/editor-utils
Level 2: @engine/gfx-webgpu, @engine/camera, @engine/script
Level 3: @engine/stdlib, @apps/editor
```

