## 📊 Key Systems Overview

### ECS (Entity-Component-System)

```typescript
// Entity: Container for components
const entity = new Entity('player');

// Components: Data holders
entity.addComponent(new TransformComponent({ position: [0, 0, 0] }));
entity.addComponent(new MeshComponent({ geometry, material }));

// Systems: Process entities with specific components
class RenderSystem {
  update(entities: Entity[]) {
    for (const entity of entities) {
      if (entity.has(TransformComponent) && entity.has(MeshComponent)) {
        this.renderer.draw(entity);
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### LogicCubes (Visual Scripting)

```typescript
// LogicCubes: Visual programming system
// Types: Trigger, Action, Condition, Data, Gate

// Example: OnPlayerEnter → PlaySound
const trigger = new OnPlayerEnterCube({ zone: 'area1' });
const action = new PlaySoundCube({ sound: 'doorOpen.wav' });

trigger.connect(action); // Visual connection
```

### WebGPU Rendering Pipeline

```typescript
// 1. Create renderer
const renderer = new Renderer(canvas);

// 2. Setup scene
const scene = new Scene();
scene.add(entity);

// 3. Render loop
function render() {
  renderer.render(scene, camera);
  requestAnimationFrame(render);
}
```

